[en.DECISION_C15_C01_RE_ELECTION]
Immediate Re-election

[en.DECISION_C15_C01_RE_ELECTION_desc]
Equestria Empire demands an immediate re-election of the Crystal Empire Council on the pretext of the recent election being rigged.

[zh.DECISION_C15_C01_RE_ELECTION]
立即重新选举

[zh.DECISION_C15_C01_RE_ELECTION_desc]
小马利亚帝国以最近的选举被操纵为借口，要求立即重新选举水晶帝国理事会。
